      "content": "i feel like everything my family built is just... being ruined by me. my grandfather, my parents, they all worked so hard to make this name mean something, and i'm just the part that's rotten. it's like i'm a stain on a perfect silk cloth. i just want to stop being the reason they're ashamed.",
